{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02752","headline":"中和乐九章 歌公卿第八 · 卢照邻","name":"中和乐九章 歌公卿第八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹇蹇三事，师师百僚。\n羣龙在职，振鹭盈朝。\n丰金辉首，佩玉鸣腰。\n青蒲翼翼，丹地翘翘。\n歌云佐汉，捧日匡尧。\n天工人代，邈邈昭昭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}